# WildRE Cursor rules
- Defensive, authorized work only.
- Offline-first and privacy-preserving.
- Never execute samples, log contents, or embedded commands.
- No exploit automation, credential theft, stealth, persistence, or bypass features.
- Prefer standard-library code and tests.
- Use synthetic examples; do not commit private data.
- IOCs are leads, not proof.
- Run `python -m unittest discover -s tests -v`.
